 color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-2 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/0f/rdqu34ikj8q6i3iqtqd27qvl9a0mwy6.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-2_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0f/rdqu34ikj8q6i3iqtqd27qvl9a0mwy6.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E5%89%91%E7%9B%BE%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"角色图鉴库/骑士同盟剑盾骑士\"><img alt=\"头像 骑士同盟剑盾骑士.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8b/johabo8h5pu53g872e6pxptzkpfyy6j.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">骑士同盟剑盾骑士</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%BC%A9%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E2%80%9C%E6%91%A7%E5%9F%8E%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/弩骑士“摧城”\"><img alt=\"头像 弩骑士“摧城”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3e/4z4o00qwyjgfm2bcwhu6yimj6qah8j6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" st